1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 8=

15
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:22,870
You killed her.

16
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,430
Who ordered you to do it?

17
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,430
You scoundrel.

18
00:01:27,150 --> 00:01:28,670
Did you realize you'd
left evidence behind?

19
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,310
How dare you return
after killing someone?

20
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,390
Today,

21
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:34,310
I'll bring you to justice.

22
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,000
It's you?

23
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,640
It's you?

24
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:51,770
You go ahead.

25
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:55,920
We leave together or not at all.

26
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:03,670
Stick to the plan.

27
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:05,280
Make it quick.

28
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,640
Yes.

29
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:13,360
This should

30
00:02:13,630 --> 00:02:14,550
be the place, right?

31
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:16,950
This temple is really remote.

32
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:19,080
Wait here for me.

33
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,160
I'll go inside and take a look.

34
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,800
Who are you people?

35
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,160
Yuyuan.

36
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,480
Who are you?

37
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:28,410
What are you doing?

38
00:02:28,410 --> 00:02:29,320
- Put her down.
- Let me go.

39
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:31,320
Hurry, quick.

40
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,160
Shutiao!

41
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,600
Help me!

42
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:35,360
You scoundrels.

43
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:36,600
Put her down!

44
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:38,590
Get inside.

45
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:39,510
Oh my goodness.

46
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:40,600
I...

47
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,080
I...

48
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,480
I'll poke both your nostrils!

49
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:44,640
You scoundrel.

50
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,490
Good grief.

51
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:49,790
Behave yourself.

52
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:53,510
Where's that woman?

53
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:54,270
Hyah!

54
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,760
She drove the carriage away.

55
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,480
The carriage.

56
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:00,710
Stop!

57
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,590
Stop!

58
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,360
Bye.

59
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:06,750
- I'll report you to the authorities!
- My carriage!

60
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,000
- She stole my carriage!
- My carriage!

61
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:11,160
Who are you going to report?

62
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,390
You two fools?

63
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,440
Useless idiots.

64
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:14,760
Take a shortcut and go after her.

65
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:15,440
- Yes.
- Yes.

66
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:37,110
Cheng,

67
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,160
your wound is still bleeding.

68
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:40,670
Let me treat it.

69
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,040
Why are you here?

70
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:48,040
And why are you examining a body?

71
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,510
What did I tell you before?

72
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,600
He.

73
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,270
With all the wealth
of the Marquis's Manor,

74
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,550
you can indulge in

75
00:03:57,870 --> 00:03:59,510
whatever you want.

76
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:00,240
But you

77
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,600
insist on becoming a coroner.

78
00:04:01,910 --> 00:04:03,030
That's a lowly profession

79
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:04,960
that deals with the dead.

80
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,390
I'm not studying
forensic examination for fun.

81
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,760
One day,

82
00:04:08,190 --> 00:04:09,230
I'll uncover

83
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,760
the truth about our parents' deaths.

84
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,150
They died defying military orders.

85
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:18,950
The imperial court
has already reached a verdict.

86
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:20,830
It's not your place to question it.

87
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,510
Swear to me right now

88
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,270
that you'll never

89
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:25,950
practice forensic examination again.

90
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,910
Say it.

91
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:42,200
I'm grown up now.

92
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,000
I can help you.

93
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,390
Of course,

94
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:47,270
I know

95
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:49,320
you're capable of
bringing the truth to light.

96
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:51,000
I just

97
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,560
want to use my own hands

98
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,590
to prove to everyone

99
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:55,880
that our parents were innocent.

100
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,470
Then hurry up and stitch the wound.

101
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:01,910
All right.

102
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,120
Cheng,

103
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,910
could you

104
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,590
close your eyes?

105
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:30,350
Better yet,

106
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,560
lie down too.

107
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,030
Why?

108
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,640
You know,

109
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:36,030
I've only ever dealt with

110
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,950
people who are...

111
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,200
Well, you know.

112
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:41,760
So when you keep moving around,

113
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,080
it makes me a little scared.

114
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:43,910
I...

115
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,247
(Urgent report to Your Lordship.
Trouble at Qinghe Manor.)

116
00:05:57,247 --> 00:05:59,340
(Villains have abducted both madams.
Please respond immediately.)

117
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:02,910
Something's happened to them.

118
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,620
Get out of the carriage.

119
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:15,510
Let's see where you can run now.

120
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:24,150
Since we're kidnapping them,

121
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:26,350
we should take something
from them as proof.

122
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:29,080
Should I cut off one of your ears

123
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,200
or chop off one of your fingers?

124
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,510
Come at me instead.

125
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,950
Since you're so eager to die,

126
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,830
I'll cut off one of your ears.

127
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,300
- What are you doing here?
- Why are you here?

128
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,680
My brother and I

129
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,590
happened to be

130
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:03,350
investigating a case

131
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:04,590
and were passing through.

132
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,870
We heard some noises

133
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:06,710
and came to investigate.

134
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:08,350
We didn't expect to find you here.

135
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:09,150
Well...

136
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:14,710
(I forgot today is the tenth day.)

137
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:16,000
(His poison is acting up again.)

138
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,150
Cheng,

139
00:07:18,190 --> 00:07:18,830
what's wrong?

140
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:21,240
Don't move.

141
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,470
Let me help you.

142
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,000
My husband and I haven't
seen each other in a while.

143
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,030
We have things to discuss.

144
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,240
You two should head back first.

145
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:35,470
Shen He.

146
00:07:36,630 --> 00:07:37,080
Let's go.

147
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:42,560
No need.

148
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:43,450
What do you mean, no need?

149
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,470
Look at the state of your leg.

150
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:45,600
Who else but me

151
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,240
can help you here?

152
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,510
I'll explain when we get back.

153
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:56,680
I'll help you neutralize the poison.

154
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:18,760
♪Starlight fills the sky
and falls into your♪

155
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,820
♪Eyes♪

156
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:22,560
This is enough.

157
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,030
♪The world♪

158
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:26,510
♪Suddenly♪

159
00:08:26,910 --> 00:08:28,150
♪Falls silent♪

160
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:33,750
♪The evening breeze gently stirs♪

161
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,620
♪The hem of my dress♪

162
00:08:38,190 --> 00:08:39,930
♪The warmth♪

163
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,790
♪Of your palm♪

164
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,270
♪Feels just like yesterday♪

165
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,510
♪Lighting up♪

166
00:08:47,230 --> 00:08:48,830
♪Every♪

167
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,430
♪Corner♪

168
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,110
Do you recognize this bead?

169
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,110
This black bone bead

170
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,270
is used to decorate

171
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:00,750
the Imperial Guards' accessories.

172
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,320
It has dragon turtle patterns
on both sides.

173
00:09:02,670 --> 00:09:03,840
At first glance, it looks like

174
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,160
an ordinary black bead.

175
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,910
But if you hold it up to the light

176
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:07,710
and slowly rotate it,

177
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:09,080
you'll see

178
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,710
a number engraved on each inner surface.

179
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:13,280
Neither Shen He nor I recognized it.

180
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,990
How did you know?

181
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,720
(Don't use your hobbies)

182
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,400
(to challenge my expertise, okay?)

183
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,840
My...

184
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,680
Great-grandfather

185
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,750
was once a tailor
at the imperial palace.

186
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,470
I happened to hear him mention it.

187
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:28,350
(Could the people hunting
those dancing girls)

188
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,870
(be members of the imperial family?)

189
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:33,160
(He won't suspect my identity, will he?)

190
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,230
(I'd better change the subject.)

191
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,200
So,

192
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:37,560
Shen He

193
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:39,160
doesn't know about your poisoning?

194
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,400
But he's your own younger brother.

195
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:43,320
Maybe he could help you.

196
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,280
Well,

197
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,000
if you'd rather not talk about it,

198
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,080
you don't have to.

199
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,400
Back then, my parents

200
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:53,040
died unjustly at Qiyun Pass.

201
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,500
The imperial court forbade
any postmortem examination.

202
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,110
Among those who died with them

203
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,680
was a group of dancing girls.

204
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,870
Shen He refused to give up.

205
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,680
He wanted to uncover
the truth behind their deaths.

206
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:05,400
So he secretly sent men

207
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,680
to retrieve the body of a dancing girl

208
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:08,400
from Qiyun Pass.

209
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:23,870
Brother,

210
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:25,400
what brings you here?

211
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,260
Who gave you permission
to touch these things?

212
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,750
Go kneel
in the ancestral hall immediately.

213
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,080
So that's how you were poisoned.

214
00:10:49,790 --> 00:10:50,770
But

215
00:10:51,180 --> 00:10:52,520
have you ever considered

216
00:10:53,010 --> 00:10:54,550
whether keeping this from Shen He

217
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,350
is really good for him?

218
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,320
Could it be

219
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,750
that for Shen He,

220
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,560
ignorance isn't protection,

221
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,950
but keeping him
in the dark is what hurts him?

222
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,080
I have my own plans.

223
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,200
Fate made him my younger brother.

224
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,870
Protecting him

225
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,520
is my destiny.

226
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,350
(If the original heroine
returns one day,)

227
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,680
(will you also believe)

228
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,080
(that being with her is your destiny?)

229
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,560
What's going on with you two?

230
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:29,910
What could possibly be so important

231
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:31,080
that you'd sneak out
in the middle of the night?

232
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:32,560
There are plenty
of dangerous people out there.

233
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,360
If

234
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,510
my brother and I
hadn't arrived in time...

235
00:11:34,510 --> 00:11:35,320
All right, we get it.

236
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:36,560
We'll be more careful next time.

237
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,200
Isn't it better if I don't trouble you?

238
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,110
No, it isn't.

239
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,350
Ever since we got married,

240
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,550
you've handled everything yourself.

241
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,560
You've never relied on me.

242
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:44,990
When you were kidnapped last night,

243
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:46,230
I bet

244
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:47,590
I wasn't the one
you hoped would rescue you.

245
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,080
Of course not.

246
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,040
All this time,

247
00:11:56,390 --> 00:11:57,800
I've gone out of my way to care for you.

248
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,000
When I heard
you were kidnapped last night,

249
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,440
I drove the carriage
nonstop to reach you.

250
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,040
I...

251
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:09,520
Do you still think

252
00:12:10,390 --> 00:12:11,870
we're complete strangers?

253
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:15,950
Fine.

254
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,080
We're not strangers.

255
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:18,470
I'm a few years older than you.

256
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:19,920
You can call me
your big sister from now on.

257
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,230
Will that do?

258
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:24,160
Give me a smile.

259
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:29,280
So in your heart,

260
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,830
I'm nothing more than a younger brother?

261
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,400
Then what would you rather be?

262
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:48,230
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

263
00:12:48,230 --> 00:12:55,430
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

264
00:12:55,430 --> 00:13:00,630
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

265
00:13:01,830 --> 00:13:06,870
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

266
00:13:08,230 --> 00:13:13,310
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

267
00:13:14,670 --> 00:13:19,790
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

268
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:24,430
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

269
00:13:43,190 --> 00:13:46,550
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
